msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Oh! Takasu-kun detected!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ah! ¡Takasu-kun detectado!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「...!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「...!」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How's it going, Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo te va, Kushieda?」"

msgid "Minori「Someone's in the classroom asking for＿you. Apparently they have something＿of yours.」"
msgstr "Minori「Hay alguien en el salón preguntando por＿ti. Al parecer tiene algo tuyo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Something of mine? I wonder what it＿is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Algo mío? Me pregunto qué será.」"

msgid "Minori「They were carrying something pretty＿big. Right, Taiga?」"
msgstr "Minori「Cargaba algo bastante grande.＿¿Verdad, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Got it. You can go back to the＿classroom. Thanks for coming to tell＿me, Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entendido. Ya puedes volver＿al salón. Gracias por venir＿a avisarme, Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「Think nothing of it! Oh, but don't forget＿though!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No es nada! Ah, ¡pero no lo olvides!」"

msgid "Minori「Was that an acquaintance of yours?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Era algún conocido tuyo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah...... He came to return something＿we'd exchanged a while back.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí...... Vino a devolver algo que＿intercambiamos hace tiempo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Which was what?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Y qué era?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Doesn't matter.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I OWE you? Excuse me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Que les DEBO? ¿Perdón?」"

msgid "Taiga「S-P-I-L-L.」"
msgstr "Taiga「C-U-É-N-T-A-L-O.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't remember it too clearly, but＿apparently at some point late last year＿the two of us traded clothes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No lo recuerdo muy bien, pero＿al parecer a fines del año pasado＿los dos intercambiamos ropa.」"

msgid "Minori「Your clothes? Why?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Su ropa? ¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Beats me. My memory of it isn't too＿clear.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni idea. No tengo muy＿claro ese recuerdo.」"

msgid "Taiga「What were the outfits?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué ropa era?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......The suit I was wearing for the bear＿costume he was wearing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......El traje que yo llevaba por＿el disfraz de oso que él traía.」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ah.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I wonder why we traded 'em. I don't＿remember.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me pregunto por qué los cambiamos.＿No lo recuerdo.」"

msgid "Minori「Huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't remember?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No lo recuerdas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nope. But if I haven't remembered it＿by this point, I figure I'll be fine without＿it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No. Pero si no lo he recordado＿a estas alturas, supongo que＿estaré bien sin eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wait, but that's......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Espera, pero eso es......!」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, you're right. Even without your＿memories, you're still our Takasu-kun!」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, tienes razón. ¡Aun sin tus＿recuerdos, sigues siendo nuestro＿Takasu-kun!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Even my mother told me not to try to＿rush things, so as things stand, I don't＿think it's a big deal.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hasta mi madre me dijo que no intente＿apresurar las cosas, así que tal como＿están, no creo que sea gran problema.」"

msgid "Taiga「..................」"
msgstr "Taiga「..................」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, I don't think you need to rush it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, no creo que debas apresurarte.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh man, I wish I could've been there～」"
msgstr "Minori「Ay, ojalá hubiera estado ahí～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You just wish you could see me in a＿bear costume.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo querías verme con＿un disfraz de oso.」"

msgid "Minori「Hahahaha! You got me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jajajaja! ¡Me descubriste!」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「You guys sure are lively. Let me in on＿the fun.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Qué animados están. Déjenme＿sumarme a la diversión.」"

msgid "Minori「You see, apparently Takasu-kun wore＿a bear costume last year.」"
msgstr "Minori「Verás, al parecer Takasu-kun usó un＿disfraz de oso el año pasado.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oho! Is that right? I definitely wish I＿could've seen that.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Oho! ¿En serio? Sin duda me＿habría gustado ver eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like I'd show you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni loco te lo muestro.」"

msgid "Minori「I want to see it too.」"
msgstr "Minori「Yo también quiero verlo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Shall we hold a masquerade＿sometime?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Hacemos una fiesta de＿disfraces algún día?」"

msgid "Minori「Sounds good!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Suena bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Kitamura「A costumed Takasu would be royally＿entertaining indeed.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Un Takasu disfrazado sería un＿espectáculo regio sin duda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Royally......? What's that supposed to＿mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Regio......? ¿Qué se supone＿que significa eso?」"

msgid "Kitamura「There there, don't fret. Now then, as＿Sensei will be arriving shortly, let's all＿take our seats.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya, ya, no te preocupes. Bueno,＿como Sensei llegará pronto, tomemos＿todos nuestros asientos.」"

msgid "Minori「Okie-doke!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Oki-doki!」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Taiga「I see......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Sigh*......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Suspiro*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......This is for the best.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Esto es lo mejor.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Just from the opening ceremony,＿somehow it's gotten so late...... I need to＿hurry home and get dinner ready......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Solo con la ceremonia de apertura ya se＿hizo muy tarde...... Debo apurarme a＿volver a casa y hacer la cena......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You scared me, popping in outta＿nowhere...... I see you haven't gone＿home yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「M-Me asustaste al aparecer＿de la nada...... Veo que aún＿no te has ido a casa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, we need to talk.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, tenemos que hablar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「About?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sobre qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「You...... You really don't have any＿feelings for Minorin?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú...... ¿De verdad ya no sientes＿nada por Minorin?」"

msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "¿Por qué lo preguntas?"

msgid "Not everything will go back to how it was"
msgstr "No todo volverá a ser como antes"

msgid "Your lips are chapped"
msgstr "Tienes los labios agrietados"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why do you ask?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué lo preguntas?」"

msgid "Taiga「\"Why\"? Because you're acting weird＿today!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿\"Por qué\"? ¡Porque hoy＿estás actuando raro!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo así?」"

msgid "Taiga「\"How so\"......? I don't know, it's just＿weird! SUPER weird!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿\"Cómo así\"......? No sé,＿¡es raro! ¡SÚPER raro!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure you're not just imagining things?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Segura que no te lo estás imaginando?」"

msgid "Taiga「Imagining things? As if!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Imaginándolo? ¡Claro que no!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Then maybe you just think I'm weird＿because I stopped liking Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Entonces tal vez te parezco raro＿porque dejó de gustarme Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When we first met, I was already in love＿with Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando nos conocimos, yo ya estaba＿enamorado de Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「So you're saying you really don't......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿O sea que de verdad ya no......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「......What a joke.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Qué chiste.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not joking. I'm dead serious.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No bromeo. Hablo totalmente en serio.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then that's all the worse!! Forget it!! I'm＿totally done with you!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Pues peor aún!! ¡¡Olvídalo!! ¡¡Ya＿no quiero saber nada de ti!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't run! You'll fall!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No corras! ¡¡Te vas a caer!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Aaagh!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aaagh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I told you so!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Te lo dije!」"

msgid "Taiga「Owwww～......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aaaay～......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, are you okay!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Taiga, estás bien?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Stay away! I don't need you!! I have no＿use for a stupid ungrateful dog like＿you!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aléjate! ¡¡No te necesito!!＿¡¡No me sirve un perro tonto＿e ingrato como tú!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ungrateful......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ingrato......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... I'm sorry.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... Lo siento.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not everything will go back to how it＿was.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No todo volverá a ser como antes.」"

msgid "Taiga「It won't......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No volverá......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nope. Some things can't be repaired＿after they break.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No. Hay cosas que no pueden repararse＿después de romperse.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My memories, and feelings for＿Kushieda, have already vanished.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mis recuerdos y mis sentimientos＿por Kushieda ya desaparecieron.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's different.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es distinto.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「That crystal can shine just as brightly,＿even with cracks.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ese cristal puede brillar igual de＿fuerte, incluso con grietas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「When I went on stage, the stage lights＿blinded me, but I think that crystal was＿the brightest of all.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cuando subí al escenario, los focos＿me cegaron, pero creo que ese cristal＿fue lo más brillante de todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「That crystal sparkled the most during＿Christmas.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ese cristal brilló más＿que nada en Navidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's why, even though I didn't like＿singing with StuChi, I still tried my＿best.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por eso, aunque no me gustara cantar con＿StuChi, igual di lo mejor de mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「More than wanting to be a good girl, I＿wanted to spend a fun Christmas＿together with everyone.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Más que querer ser una niña buena,＿quería pasar una Navidad divertida＿junto a todos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The crystal looked pretty on top of the＿tree, too. Everyone there was like＿\"Wooow!\" when they saw it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El cristal también se veía lindo en＿la punta del árbol. Todos dijeron＿\"¡Uaaau!\" cuando lo vieron.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga......?」"

msgid "Taiga「......It's coming back to you, see?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Lo estás recordando, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Your memory of Christmas Eve is＿coming back to you! How it started,＿how it ended, all of it!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Estás recuperando tus recuerdos＿de Nochebuena! ¡¡Cómo empezó,＿cómo terminó, todo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「--!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「--!!」"

msgid "Taiga「And yet why!? WHY would you wait＿until now to say that you've fallen out＿of love with Minorin!?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Y aun así por qué?! ¡¿POR QUÉ＿esperaste hasta ahora para decir＿que dejaste de amar a Minorin?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（S-Shit!!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡M-Mierda!!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, your lips are chapped.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, tienes los labios agrietados.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Where'd THAT come from?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¿Y ESO a qué viene?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Your lips. They look painfully dry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tus labios. Se ven muy resecos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? They're fine. I can just lick＿them.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Perdón? Están bien. Puedo＿simplemente lamerlos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Do you have lip balm on you? If you＿don't, use this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Traes bálsamo labial? Si＿no tienes, usa este.」"

msgid "Taiga「Lip balm? Why did you have this?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Bálsamo labial? ¿Por qué tenías esto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I got it from Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me lo dio Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「From Minorin!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿De Minorin?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come on, hold still. I'll put it on for you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vamos, quédate quieta. Te lo pongo yo.」"

msgid "Taiga「I-Idiot! That's a gift you got specially＿from Minorin! Don't use it on me!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡I-Idiota! ¡Es un regalo especial que te＿dio Minorin! ¡¡No lo uses conmigo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But it was meant to be used to soothe＿dry lips. I'm using it as intended.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero sirve para aliviar los labios＿resecos. Le estoy dando su uso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hang on, Ryuuji!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Espera, Ryuuji!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, don't move! It'll go in your nose!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye, no te muevas! ¡Se＿te meterá en la nariz!」"

msgid "Taiga「Nnnn!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Nnnn!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There we are... Be nice and still for＿me...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahí vamos... Quédate quietita...」"

msgid "Taiga「......You're the one trying to put it in my＿nose.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tú eres el que intenta＿metérmelo en la nariz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wouldn't happen if you would just hold＿still.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pasaría si te quedaras quieta.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Why are you looking at me so＿seriously?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Por qué me miras tan serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In order to avoid the lip balm going up＿your nose.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para evitar que el bálsamo＿se te meta en la nariz.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tsk.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Taiga「Sheesh. How did it come to this......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cielos. ¿Cómo llegamos a esto......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There, all done.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Listo, ya quedó.」"

msgid "Taiga「AHA!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡AJÁ!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's got you screaming all of a＿sudden?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué gritas tan de repente?」"

msgid "Taiga「Come to think of it, I never asked you＿to put it on for me, did I!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora que lo pienso, ¡¿yo nunca te＿pedí que me lo pusieras, verdad?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, no......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, no......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（The point was to distract you......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（La idea era distraerte......）」"

msgid "Taiga「And you didn't really answer my＿question!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Y tampoco respondiste mi pregunta!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That aside, Taiga, you can keep this lip＿balm.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dejando eso aparte, Taiga,＿quédate este bálsamo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's brand new. You can get plenty of＿use out of it, so use it instead of me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está nuevo. Le puedes sacar mucho＿provecho, así que úsalo en mi lugar.」"

msgid "Taiga「But didn't you get it from Minorin!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Pero no te lo dio Minorin?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You already used it once. You wouldn't＿want me to use it after you, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya lo usaste una vez. No querrás que＿lo use después de ti, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「But......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Taiga「......Oh, I see how it is.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ah, ya veo cómo es.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's how you think of Minorin now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así es como ves a Minorin ahora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga......」"

msgid "Taiga「That's enough!! I don't care!! Do＿whatever you want!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Basta!! ¡¡No me importa!! ¡¡Haz＿lo que te dé la gana!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, don't run! You'll fall!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye, no corras! ¡¡Te vas a caer!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Aaagh!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aaagh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I told you so!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Te lo dije!」"

msgid "Taiga「Owww～......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aaay～......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, are you okay!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Taiga, estás bien?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Stay away! I don't need you!! I have no＿use for a stupid ungrateful dog like＿you!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aléjate! ¡¡No te necesito!!＿¡¡No me sirve un perro tonto＿e ingrato como tú!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ungrateful......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ingrato......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... I'm sorry.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... Lo siento.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Sorry, Taiga...... But I've decided to keep＿this one thing to myself.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Perdón, Taiga...... Pero decidí＿guardarme esto solo para mí.）」"

msgid "???「Takasu.」"
msgstr "???「Takasu.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, are you heading home?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, ¿ya vas a casa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. Do you have practice?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. ¿Tienes práctica?」"

msgid "Kitamura「I did, but it's already over. I have a＿student council meeting now, though.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Tenía, pero ya terminó. Aunque ahora＿tengo junta del consejo estudiantil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The new semester's barely started and＿already you're so busy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Apenas empieza el nuevo semestre＿y ya estás tan ocupado.」"

msgid "Minori「Alriiight, here I gooo!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Bieeen, allá voooy!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, that voice......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, esa voz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's Kushieda......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es Kushieda......」"

msgid "Minori「Right fiiield!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Jardín derechooo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Minori「NICE CATCH!! Keep it up!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡BUENA ATRAPADA!! ¡Sigan así!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She's so carefree.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Se ve tan despreocupada.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah. Watching Kushieda practice is＿quite refreshing. I'm sure it's because＿she's playing earnestly.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí. Ver entrenar a Kushieda es＿muy refrescante. Seguro es porque＿juega con toda el alma.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I like that about Kushieda. I respect＿her!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Eso me gusta de Kushieda. ¡La respeto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I like her too, Kitamura.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（A mí también me gusta, Kitamura.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「What's wrong, Takasu?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa, Takasu?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing at all, really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada, en serio.」"

msgid "Kitamura「That so? You're starting to look like＿Scarface.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Sí? Empiezas a parecerte a Scarface.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Just kidding.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Es broma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura～!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kitamura～!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hahahaha! Okay, be careful on your＿way home.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Jajajaja! Bueno, ten cuidado＿de camino a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......*Sigh*」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......*Suspiro*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（You're right, Taiga. It's just as you say.＿Even now, I like Kushieda.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tienes razón, Taiga. Es tal como dices.＿Aun ahora, me gusta Kushieda.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But if Kushieda wishes \"not to see＿ghosts,\" then I don't want to show them＿to her.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero si Kushieda desea \"no＿ver fantasmas\", entonces no＿quiero mostrárselos.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's why I won't admit how I feel. Not＿to her, not to Kitamura, not to you, not＿to anyone.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por eso no admitiré lo que siento.＿Ni a ella, ni a Kitamura, ni＿a ti, ni a nadie.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If no one finds out, if no one sees it,＿even if it may as well be a ghost, it will＿always exist inside me.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si nadie se entera, si nadie lo ve,＿aunque sea como un fantasma, siempre＿existirá dentro de mí.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So Taiga, I think I'm gonna keep this＿my little secret. It's my secret＿one-sided crush.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que, Taiga, creo que guardaré＿este pequeño secreto. Es mi amor＿secreto no correspondido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's for no one's sake but my own. This＿is the form my love takes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es por nadie más que por mí mismo.＿Esta es la forma que toma mi amor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm sure it'll be fine like this...... That's＿what I believe......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Seguro estará bien así......＿Eso es lo que creo......」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá debería＿agradecerte por tu esfuerzo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que llegaste a este final, la＿razón por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre la＿ruta que elegiste. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos al respecto.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, entonces evaluemos el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, comencemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「I see. You remembered something＿important, but you decided to keep it＿buried deep within your heart.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ya veo. Recordaste algo importante,＿pero decidiste mantenerlo enterrado＿en lo hondo de tu corazón.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hmm～ That's quite mature of you, you＿know? I'm not opposed to your＿decision.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Mmm～ Qué maduro de tu parte, ¿sabes?＿No me opongo a tu decisión.」"

msgid "Yuri「But you see, relationships between＿people won't progress on maturity＿alone. You've got to be proactive.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Pero verás, las relaciones humanas＿no avanzan solo con madurez. Tienes＿que tomar la iniciativa.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well, all that aside, if I could grade this＿ending, I guess I'd give it 70 points.＿Let's put some more effort into it.」"
msgstr "Yuri「En fin, si tuviera que calificar＿este final, le daría 70 puntos.＿Esforcémonos un poco más.」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

